---
description: Delivery Plane, domains, and publication rules
alwaysApply: true
---
One logical Delivery Plane serves many verified custom hostnames. Unknown hosts fail closed.
Clients ship on theircompany.com. Preview uses a private noindex host and must not send production email or social.
Standardize funnel capabilities, not visual identity. Do not generate cloned AI websites.
Client page publication updates an immutable page version and invalidates cache. It is not a Vector code deploy.
Cache static assets and stable public pages at the edge when safe. Do not cache personalized, consent-sensitive, authenticated, or experiment-sensitive responses without an explicit cache key.
A homepage load is not a launch. Domain, HTTPS, lead path, attribution, analytics, and recorded approval are required.
